codex
The cached market list is filtered through `_drop_expired_markets()` every scan before hydration, so a reused HYPE list can contain old objects internally but expired ones are removed before strategy scanning. One subtle risk remains: a throttled list can miss a just-opened HYPE market for up to the throttle interval, but that is not worse than the old 60s loop.
