   613	    """Measure one strategy scan wall time and HARD-CAP it.
   614	
   615	    The parallel scan is an ``asyncio.gather`` — it completes only when the
   616	    SLOWEST lane finishes. A single hung lane (e.g. Hyperliquid OHLCV stalling:
   617	    bisection-recursed sync fetches stacking to 38-60s) therefore drags the whole
   618	    cycle to ~60s, freezing exits/dashboard and tripping the status orb. The inner
   619	    ``analysis_with_timeout`` (15s) only caps each get_full_analysis call, not the
   620	    per-lane total. This wait_for bounds the WHOLE lane: on timeout the lane is
