    56	  # window instead of re-fetching from gamma every ~60s cycle (the dominant non-analysis
    57	  # cost + source of slug-fetch timeouts). Re-fetch only when the window bucket advances or
    58	  # the max-age backstop trips; prices stay live on the separate WS/midpoint path. Set
    59	  # enabled:false for byte-identical legacy behavior. Max-age = window + 60s buffer by default.
